<!-- ================== SECTION 9: STORY / FAMILY ================== -->
<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="story-inner">
    <div class="story-upgrade">
      <div class="story-founder-video" data-video data-name="Mees van Lier · Founder" data-quote="Why we built Lio — a 2-minute story from the workshop.">
        <div class="story-founder-duration">2:14</div>
        <div class="story-founder-play">
          <svg><use href="#play-solid"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="story-founder-label">
          <strong>Meet Mees — founder</strong>
          <span>Why we built Lio · filmed in the Amsterdam workshop</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="story-family-photo" aria-label="The Van Lier family in Amsterdam, 2024">
        <div class="story-family-photo-caption">
          <strong>The Van Lier family.</strong> Amsterdam, early 2024. Still the whole team behind every Lio that ships.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story-body">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Our story</div>
      <h2 class="section-h2">
        We built this <span class="italic-word">for our own family.</span>
      </h2>

      <div class="story-text">
        <p>
          Lio started in 2022 around a very specific problem: a family member wanted to drop a long-standing hand-to-mouth habit, and everything on the market was either <strong>a chemical substitute</strong> (patches, gum, more nicotine) or <strong>nothing at all.</strong>
        </p>
        <p>
          We thought the habit deserved a physical object. Something weighted. Something you keep on your desk, in your pocket, on the nightstand. Something that gives the hand, the breath, and the pause back — without the thing it was built around.
        </p>
        <p>
          Four years later, over <strong>150,000 people</strong> across the EU, UK and UAE use Lio daily. We're still a small family company in Amsterdam. Every core is tested. Every walnut body is hand-finished. Every customer email gets read.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="story-signature">
        <div class="story-signature-avatar">M</div>
        <div class="story-signature-text">
          <strong>Mees van Lier</strong>
          <span>Founder · Lio · Amsterdam</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Lio · Story",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-lio-story",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Lio · Story" }],
  "enabled_on": { "templates": ["index", "page"] }
}
{% endschema %}
